# llama.cpp server conformance allowlist
#
# One `<test id>  # <reason>` per line. A test id is the upstream path plus
# the pytest node name, exactly as the runner reports it. An entry says: this
# upstream behavior is one odai does not implement, and here is why that is
# acceptable. The runner exits non-zero when an entry now passes or when an id
# is not reported at all, so the list only ever shrinks on its own.
#
# Generate the initial list with:
#   pnpm run conformance:llama-cpp-server
# then move each unexpected failure here with a reason.

